{"4815220": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hearthside: Your Custom Fireplace", "steam_appid": 4815220, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Your Hearthside</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hearthside: Your Custom Fireplace</strong> is a relaxing simulation designed to be a digital comfort zone. Whether you need a backdrop while studying, reading, or relaxing after work, Hearthside is built for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4815220/extras/de24af12ba748dc1445854522e9f5122.poster.avif?t=1786644967\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4815220/extras/de24af12ba748dc1445854522e9f5122.webm?t=1786644967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4815220/extras/de24af12ba748dc1445854522e9f5122.mp4?t=1786644967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customization Options</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control the exact look of your environment with a highly customizable setup.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>66 Wall Styles:</strong> Cycle through 66 wall variations across 7 material groups including Brick, Wood, Tile, Marble, Metal, and Festive. <i>(More textures are constantly being added)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Fire:</strong> Choose between multiple log arrangements and adjust the physical size of the fire—from a glowing ember to a roaring blaze.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fire Dynamics:</strong> Fine-tune the behavior of the flames by adjusting the fire's speed, opacity, and overall intensity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smoke &amp; Embers:</strong> Toggle smoke and glowing embers on or off, and customize their specific visual options to match your preference.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Color Control:</strong> Adjust the exact color of the flames, logs, and walls using full RGB sliders, or quickly swap between a library of prechosen color palettes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Image Gallery:</strong> Import your own photos or artwork from your PC directly into the game. Set a single image, or load multiple to create a beautiful carousel slideshow that cycles through your memories on the wall.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4815220/extras/afc68a886268bd36ed84e2f35f9964ef.avif?t=1786644967\" width=1536 height=864 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ambience and Audio</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Layer different sounds together to create your ideal background noise.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 Nature Sounds:</strong> Mix and match ambient tracks including a thunderstorm, winter wind, babbling brook, and wildlands. <i>(More soundscapes coming soon)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Included Music:</strong> Listen to over 1 hour of built-in music featuring genres like Celtic, Lo-Fi, and Piano Lo-Fi. <i>(More tracks on the way)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Import Your Own Music:</strong> Import your own local audio files directly into the game to play through Hearthside's built-in audio player.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4815220/extras/c7a9685e2c4bce952a899f51ccc617f5.avif?t=1786644967\" width=1538 height=862 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Presets and Controls</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save Your Presets:</strong> Save your exact configuration to a preset slot to load it again later.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Premade Occasions:</strong> Load premade presets designed for specific moods and occasions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Camera Controls:</strong> Zoom in close to the coals or pull back to view the whole room.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4815220/extras/bc457a770c9814520f17fc155d4a368e.avif?t=1786644967\" width=1534 height=866 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upcoming Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hearthside is currently focused on atmosphere, but the development roadmap includes introducing productivity tools:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pomodoro Integration:</strong> Built-in focus timers to help you study or work.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>To-Do Lists:</strong> Keep track of your daily tasks while the app runs in the background.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Timers:</strong> Set alarms to remind you to take breaks or drink water.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Widget Mode:</strong> Snap Hearthside to the corner of your monitor while you use other apps.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Your Hearthside</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hearthside: Your Custom Fireplace</strong> is a relaxing simulation designed to be a digital comfort zone. Whether you need a backdrop while studying, reading, or relaxing after work, Hearthside is built for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4815220/extras/de24af12ba748dc1445854522e9f5122.poster.avif?t=1786644967\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4815220/extras/de24af12ba748dc1445854522e9f5122.webm?t=1786644967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4815220/extras/de24af12ba748dc1445854522e9f5122.mp4?t=1786644967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customization Options</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control the exact look of your environment with a highly customizable setup.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>66 Wall Styles:</strong> Cycle through 66 wall variations across 7 material groups including Brick, Wood, Tile, Marble, Metal, and Festive. <i>(More textures are constantly being added)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Fire:</strong> Choose between multiple log arrangements and adjust the physical size of the fire—from a glowing ember to a roaring blaze.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fire Dynamics:</strong> Fine-tune the behavior of the flames by adjusting the fire's speed, opacity, and overall intensity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smoke &amp; Embers:</strong> Toggle smoke and glowing embers on or off, and customize their specific visual options to match your preference.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Color Control:</strong> Adjust the exact color of the flames, logs, and walls using full RGB sliders, or quickly swap between a library of prechosen color palettes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Image Gallery:</strong> Import your own photos or artwork from your PC directly into the game. Set a single image, or load multiple to create a beautiful carousel slideshow that cycles through your memories on the wall.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4815220/extras/afc68a886268bd36ed84e2f35f9964ef.avif?t=1786644967\" width=1536 height=864 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ambience and Audio</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Layer different sounds together to create your ideal background noise.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 Nature Sounds:</strong> Mix and match ambient tracks including a thunderstorm, winter wind, babbling brook, and wildlands. <i>(More soundscapes coming soon)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Included Music:</strong> Listen to over 1 hour of built-in music featuring genres like Celtic, Lo-Fi, and Piano Lo-Fi. <i>(More tracks on the way)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Import Your Own Music:</strong> Import your own local audio files directly into the game to play through Hearthside's built-in audio player.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4815220/extras/c7a9685e2c4bce952a899f51ccc617f5.avif?t=1786644967\" width=1538 height=862 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Presets and Controls</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save Your Presets:</strong> Save your exact configuration to a preset slot to load it again later.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Premade Occasions:</strong> Load premade presets designed for specific moods and occasions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Camera Controls:</strong> Zoom in close to the coals or pull back to view the whole room.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4815220/extras/bc457a770c9814520f17fc155d4a368e.avif?t=1786644967\" width=1534 height=866 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upcoming Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hearthside is currently focused on atmosphere, but the development roadmap includes introducing productivity tools:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pomodoro Integration:</strong> Built-in focus timers to help you study or work.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>To-Do Lists:</strong> Keep track of your daily tasks while the app runs in the background.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Timers:</strong> Set alarms to remind you to take breaks or drink water.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Widget Mode:</strong> Snap Hearthside to the corner of your monitor while you use other apps.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A highly customizable, idle fireplace simulator. Relax to the sound of crackling flames while tailoring the atmosphere to your mood by loading your own custom images, editing wall text, and adjusting the lighting.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4815220/2b67e04d54455fc40e9168cdf81e5f8b9bbe6e4a/header.jpg?t=1786644967", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4815220/1aa7006c98f9c5b8e703f323a8bf0be57c3cff82/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786644967", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4815220/1aa7006c98f9c5b8e703f323a8bf0be57c3cff82/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786644967", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 / AMD Ryzen 3 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 660, AMD Radeon HD 7870, or equivalent DX11 compatible GPU<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Versi